WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:09.240
don't make a new year's resolution to be
a better person in 2016 I would say make

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:16.320
a resolution to be a better person now
make it a resolution of discipline to

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:24.320
get better smarter faster stronger
healthier more productive less agitated

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:35.130
to eat cleaner live more to go and do do
all those things but don't do them on

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.110
New Year's Eve don't do them on New
Year's Day

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:46.620
do them now that that resolution of
discipline to work and follow through

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:59.340
and maintain your will that'll result in
the freedom that you're looking for yes

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:04.550
you heard it once again discipline
equals freedom

